RewriteEngine On
RewriteRule ^privacy/?$ /en/privacy/ [R=301,L]
RewriteRule ^terms/?$ /en/terms/ [R=301,L]
RewriteRule ^cookies/?$ /en/cookies/ [R=301,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP:Accept-Language} ^\s*en [NC]
RewriteRule ^$ /en/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^$ /ro/ [R=302,L]
Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.html
După ce activezi SSL (Let's Encrypt) în DirectAdmin, scoate # din fața acestor 5 linii:
RewriteEngine On
RewriteCond %{HTTPS} off [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} !^www\. [NC]
RewriteRule ^ https://www.les-romania.org%{REQUEST_URI} [L,R=301]
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
Header set Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; base-uri 'self'"
Header set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
Header set Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
</IfModule>
AddType font/woff2 .woff2
<IfModule mod_expires.c>
ExpiresActive On
ExpiresByType font/woff2 "access plus 1 year"
ExpiresByType image/png "access plus 1 month"
ExpiresByType text/css "access plus 1 week"
ExpiresByType application/javascript "access plus 1 week"
</IfModule>
AuthName "Member Areas"
AuthGroupFile /dev/null
AuthType Basic
AuthUserFile /home/lesroman/domains/les-romania.org/.htpasswd/public_html/.htpasswd
require valid-user
ErrorDocument 401 "Unauthorized Access"
